          "end": 1358,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a9-16:block:1",
          "start": 1123
        },
        "quote": "Any bonds or notes issued under the provisions of this section, their transfer and the income therefrom (including any profit made on the sale thereof) shall at all times be free from taxation within this state. (C.O. 23 § 2, 7-23-73.)",
